            <abstract lang="en">
                <p>Disclosed is a battery module, and a battery pack and a vehicle including the same. The battery module includes a battery cell stack in which a plurality of battery cells are stacked; a module case configured to accommodate the battery cell stack and having a discharge hole formed to discharge gas; and a reverse inflow prevention member coupled to the module case and configured to prevent discharged matter generated from the battery cell from flowing out of the module case and then reversely flowing into the module case.</p>
